# Word of Command (CR 723.2, 723.5): Bot1 looks at Bot2's hand, chooses Lightning Bolt, and controls Bot2 until Word of
# Command finishes resolving: Bot2 casts the Bolt, Bot1 deciding its target (Bot2 itself) and tapping Bot2's own Mountain
# for it (723.5a). Bot2 is controlled while Word of Command resolves (ControlledBy is checked at the target question) and
# again while the Bolt resolves; neither control is left afterwards.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Word of Command
Swamp x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x18

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Word of Command.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
? Bot2.ControlledBy = Bot1
Bot2.Target(Bot2)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
? Stack = Lightning Bolt
? Bot2.ControlledBy = (absent)
? Bot2.NextTurnControlledBy = Bot1+resolving
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot2.ControlledBy = (absent)
Bot2.NextTurnControlledBy = (absent)
